[{"answer":"Oh good morning. You must be James.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm Beth Cartwright - please call me Beth.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Now as this is your first tutorial since you started on the Scandinavian Studies course,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to find out something about you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Why did you decide to take this course?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, my mother is Danish, and although we always lived in England, she used to talk about her home a lot,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/7.mp3"},{"answer":"and that made me want to visit Denmark.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/8.mp3"},{"answer":"We hardly ever did, though - my mother usually went on her own.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/9.mp3"},{"answer":"But whenever her relations or friends were in England they always came to see us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/11.mp3"},{"answer":"So I assume you already speak Danish, one of the languages you'll be studying.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I can get by when I talk to people, though I'm not terribly accurate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Now you probably know that you'll spend the third year of the course abroad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you had any thoughts about that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm really looking forward to it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/16.mp3"},{"answer":"And although Denmark seems the obvious place to go, because of my family connections,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/17.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd love to spend the time in Iceland.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I'm sure it can be arranged.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have any plans for when you graduate?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/20.mp3"},{"answer":"A lot of students go on to take a master's degree.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I think the four years of the undergraduate course will be enough for me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm interested in journalism,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/23.mp3"},{"answer":"and I quite like the idea of moving to Scandinavia and writing for magazines.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd find that more creative than translating, which I suppose most graduates do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/25.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Now how are you finding the courses you're taking this term, James?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'm really enjoying the one on Swedish cinema.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/28.mp3"},{"answer":"That'll continue next term,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/29.mp3"},{"answer":"but the one on Scandinavian literature that's running at the moment will be replaced by more specialised courses.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, and by the way, if you're interested in watching Danish television programmes -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/31.mp3"},{"answer":"there's going to be a course on that the term after next.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/32.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you started thinking about the literature paper that you have to write in the next few weeks?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, my first choice would be to do something on the Icelandic sagas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/35.mp3"},{"answer":"The trouble with that is that a lot of people choose that topic,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/36.mp3"},{"answer":"and it can be difficult to get hold of the books you'll need.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Why not leave that for another time?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/39.mp3"},{"answer":"You might find modern novels or 19th century playwrights interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/40.mp3"},{"answer":"I've read or seen several plays in translation, so that would be a good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll put you down for that topic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. So what would you advise me to aim at in the paper?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/44.mp3"},{"answer":"First I suggest you avoid taking one writer and going into a great deal of detail.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/45.mp3"},{"answer":"That approach certainly has its place,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/46.mp3"},{"answer":"but I think you first need to get an understanding of the literature in the context of the society in which it was produced -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/47.mp3"},{"answer":"who it was written for, how it was published, and so on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/48.mp3"},{"answer":"I also think that's more fruitful than placing it within the history of the genre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/49.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, that sounds reasonable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Could I ask for some advice about writing the paper I'm working on about the Vikings?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I have to do that this week, and I'm a bit stuck.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you decided yet what to write about?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/54.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I haven't.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/55.mp3"},{"answer":"There's so much that seems interesting -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Viking settlement in other countries, trade, mythology...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, what I suggest is that you read an assignment a student wrote last year, which is kept in the library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/58.mp3"},{"answer":"It's short and well focused, and I'm sure you'll find it helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/59.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll give you the details in a moment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Textbooks usually cover so many topics, it can be very difficult to choose just one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/61.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/62.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got a DVD of the film about the Vikings that came out earlier this year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Should I watch that again?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/64.mp3"},{"answer":"If it's the one I am thinking of, hmm, I'd ignore it -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/65.mp3"},{"answer":"it's more fantasy than reality.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/66.mp3"},{"answer":"But I've got a recording of a documentary that you should watch.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/67.mp3"},{"answer":"It makes some interesting and provocative points, which I think will help you to focus your topic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/69.mp3"},{"answer":"So then should I work out an outline?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. Just headings for different sections, at this stage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/71.mp3"},{"answer":"And then you should start looking for suitable articles and books to draw on,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/72.mp3"},{"answer":"and take notes which you organise according to those headings.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/73.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Then put short phrases and sentences as bullet points under each heading.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Make sure that this skeleton makes sense and flows properly, before writing up the paper in full.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/76.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks, that's very helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-3-2023-04-28-15-35-41/78.mp3"}]
